#ASSERT `Is my unfair dismissal referral in time or accepted` (`d` 2 3 2026) (`d` 31 3 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is my unfair dismissal referral in time or accepted` (`d` 2 3 2026) (`d` 2 3 2026) FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is my unfair dismissal referral in time or accepted` (`d` 14 3 2026) (`d` 13 4 2026) FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is my unfair dismissal referral in time or accepted` (`d` 14 3 2026) (`d` 14 4 2026) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Is my unfair dismissal referral in time or accepted` (`d` 2 3 2026) (`d` 1 3 2026) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

