-- Contravention Tuesday 10 March 2020: last day Tuesday 10 March 2026.
#ASSERT `By when must I apply to the industrial magistrate's court` (`d` 10 3 2020) EQUALS `d` 10 3 2026
-- Contravention 7 March 2020: 7 March 2026 is a Saturday, so Monday 9 March.
#ASSERT `By when must I apply to the industrial magistrate's court` (`d` 7 3 2020) EQUALS `d` 9 3 2026
-- Contravention 28 February 2024: the period begins 29 February 2024; 2030 has no 29 February, so Thursday 28 February 2030.
#ASSERT `By when must I apply to the industrial magistrate's court` (`d` 28 2 2024) EQUALS `d` 28 2 2030
-- Contravention 29 February 2024: the period begins 1 March 2024 and ends 28 February 2030.
#ASSERT `By when must I apply to the industrial magistrate's court` (`d` 29 2 2024) EQUALS `d` 28 2 2030
-- Contravention 31 December 2019: Wednesday 31 December 2025.
#ASSERT `By when must I apply to the industrial magistrate's court` (`d` 31 12 2019) EQUALS `d` 31 12 2025

