#ASSERT `Is my application to the industrial magistrate's court in time` (`d` 10 3 2020) (`d` 11 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Is my application to the industrial magistrate's court in time` (`d` 7 3 2020) (`d` 9 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
