-- Proceedings began 15 June 2026: back to 15 June 2020.
#ASSERT `From what day can my underpayment be ordered` (`d` 15 6 2026) FALSE (`d` 1 1 2000) EQUALS `d` 15 6 2020
-- A record failure on 1 September 2026, after the start: the proceedings' 15 June 2020 is still the earlier.
#ASSERT `From what day can my underpayment be ordered` (`d` 15 6 2026) TRUE (`d` 1 9 2026) EQUALS `d` 15 6 2020
-- A record failure on 1 January 2026, before the start (an inspector's request): back to 1 January 2020.
#ASSERT `From what day can my underpayment be ordered` (`d` 15 6 2026) TRUE (`d` 1 1 2026) EQUALS `d` 1 1 2020
-- Proceedings began 29 February 2028: 2022 has no 29 February, so 1 March 2022.
#ASSERT `From what day can my underpayment be ordered` (`d` 29 2 2028) FALSE (`d` 1 1 2000) EQUALS `d` 1 3 2022

